ows the devices to recover normal operation as soon as a fault condition disappears. Fast demagnetization of inductive loads is achieved at turn-off.\nL1270: ## Features\nL1271: \nL1272: AI Translation\nL1273: \nL1274:   * Automotive qualified\nL1275:   * Drain current: 19 A\nL1276:   * ESD protection\nL1277:   * Overvoltage clamp\nL1278:   * Thermal shutdown\nL1279:   * Current and power limitation\nL1280:   * Very low standby current\nL1281:   * Very low electromagnetic susceptibility\nL1282:   * Compliant with European directive 2002/95/EC\nL1283:   * Open drain status output (VNL5050S5-E only)\nL1284: \nL1285: Every Order Guarantee\nL1286: \nL1287: 100% Authentic · 30-Day Return or Replacement\nL1288: \nL1289: Out of Stock\nL1290: \nL1291: Notify Me\nL1292: \nL1293: Minimum: 1 Multiple: 1 Sales Unit: Piece\nL1294: \nL1295: [Input]\nL1296: \nL1297: Add to Cart\n"
